From 9ef9e0517a0014c569f2230bc4a7f4eac3ae04ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:02:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] SystemUI: add a media chip to the status bar

show the active media session as an ongoing activity chip, after the
call, screen record and notification chips. the chip uses the app's
small icon, or a music note when that icon is not monochrome, and the
song title cut at the width of a chip timer. a paused session turns
the chip tonal with a pause icon. tapping it opens a compact popup with
artwork, title, a seek bar and previous / play-pause / next.
